  "prefLabel": "Agr 907.02 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Agr 907.02 Applicability. The rules in this part apply to any person who manufactures, blends, labels, distributes, sells, or offers for sale, cider in New Hampshire.\n\nSource. #6070, eff 7-28-95; ss by #6588, eff 9-26-97, EXPIRED: 9-26-05\n\nNew. #14550, eff 4-1-26, EXPIRES: 4-1-36",
